<!doctype html><html><head><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Under Maintenance</title>
<style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%,#292929,transparent 35%),#050505;color:#fff;font-family:Arial}.box{width:min(92%,680px);padding:55px 28px;text-align:center;background:#141414eF;border:1px solid #292929;border-radius:28px;box-shadow:0 25px 90px #000}.icon{width:85px;height:85px;margin:auto auto 25px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:42px;background:#fff;color:#111;animation:spin 6s linear infinite}h1{font-size:clamp(32px,8vw,58px);margin:0 0 16px;letter-spacing:2px}p{color:#aaa;line-height:1.7}.status{display:inline-flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;margin-top:25px;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:50px;background:#191919}.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff4545;box-shadow:0 0 14px #ff4545}.load{width:180px;height:5px;margin:30px auto;background:#222;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}.load span{display:block;width:45%;height:100%;background:#fff;animation:load 1.7s infinite}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes load{0%{transform:translateX(-120%)}50%,100%{transform:translateX(230%)}}small{color:#555}</style>
</head><body><div class="box"><div class="icon">⚙</div><h1>UNDER MAINTENANCE</h1><p>We’re currently performing some maintenance to improve your experience.<br>We’ll be back online shortly.</p><div class="status"><span class="dot"></span>System Maintenance</div><div class="load"><span></span></div><small>Thank you for your patience and understanding.</small></div></body></html>